        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Pui zian lou mei khuan nzaengmei",
            "Ai rui musuipui nung makge,",
            "Nang nahnun ta ganlou sini",
            "Kalum lou mei amu rio.",
            "",
            "Zauzianlou o, ai rui ningmei",
            "Kadaeng khou tei ai rui bamni",
            "Akhang kalum lou pui khuan tei",
            "Mpuan kumna akhou liu guang.",
            "",
            "2. Hei kandi hei akai ham e;",
            "Zaengsi kadi kappui ram e,",
            "Bam du khuan tho anah nunle",
            "Mulou rio, pui kalummei.",
            "",
            "3. Bu le neihmik tingkum maan ni",
            "Theipui taan guai taandat lak khe;",
            "Apui apu nzian liangmei",
            "Akhang taek makna kalum e.",
            "",
            "4. Kakhuan rui neila lou mei pui",
            "Ai rui musuipui nung makge",
            "Nang nahnun ta patlou sini",
            "Kalumloumei muhlou ri o."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
